<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-20-2-2022-defining-competencies> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Technical interoperability depends on more than a data format. Organizations also need disciplined, understandable practices for deciding what competencies mean and how they should be defined and reused." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-20-2-2022-defining-competencies/versions/1> .
